        "content": "What function calculates the mark-to-market value or gain/loss of an existing foreign-exchange forward contract before maturity, using the original contracted exchange rate and notional, the remaining-term market forward rate derived from quoted forward points and spot bid/offer rates, and an appropriate discount rate? The function should support currency-pair quote conventions and a EUR receivable hedged into GBP, with the result reported in GBP.",
