      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    spot_gbp_per_eur = 0.7343\n    three_month_offer_points = 15.0\n    points_scale = 10000\n    contract_rate = 0.7400\n    eur_notional = 5_000_000\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    current_three_month_offer = (\n        spot_gbp_per_eur + three_month_offer_points / points_scale\n    )\n    mark_to_market_gain = (\n        contract_rate - current_three_month_offer\n    ) * eur_notional\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(mark_to_market_gain, 3)\n```",
